[NAME] Descriptive name. Gives a free object a two-sided collision sphere of radius 50 at its node. Sources: analysis engine.md physics 2026-09-26; blind review (medium); adjudicated AGREE. Facts (tools/check_names.py): call:0045f490; call:0040bd2b; const:32; call:MDL_GetNodePosition.

